  "content": "<p>这是沉浸式载具模组的<b>官方内容包</b>。</p><h2><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">核心模组\"<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沉浸式载具</a>\"是运行此内容包的必要前置！<span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse链接</a>)<br></span></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#000\">OCP也可以在Modrinth上下载！<br>(以防Forge出问题)<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersive-vehicles-official-content-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CND1WIc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"100\"></a></span><a href=\"http://patreon.com/IV_official_content_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fVhkEbh.png\" alt=\"金钱生成器\" width=\"348\" height=\"100\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmtsiv_officialcontentpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SeJGwJ9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"236\" height=\"100\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eafDLSV.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"795\" height=\"362\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CxBu34m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"52\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mts-iv-official-automobile-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wi3yEwu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2048\" height=\"257\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-automotives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dWes3um.png\" width=\"856\" height=\"107\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">OCP包含先进的飞机、汽车、坦克、直升机和卡车，功能上保持简洁，<br>不仅展示了沉浸式载具模组在技术上的可能性，<br>还提供了精心构建的沉浸式且用户友好的飞行与驾驶体验。<br>所有载具和部件均可在生存模式中合成。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">深入了解以下载具吧！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/apRUgYe.png\" alt=\"\"></h4><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RxK3sCS.png\" alt=\"天鹰与贝尔206\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MfGIpIt.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ybvv7Xa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aE3MVrL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HY7wchP.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><h4><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nb5LNxq.png\" alt=\"\"></h4><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aNKRbE4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1395\" height=\"966\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5HEH2rk.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h4>&nbsp;<strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/blFi6rM.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h4><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F6iFmRL.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3d3yeOk.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jeTK6PU.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><ul>\n<li>以及装饰</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/otpbypM.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cEQDpXv.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minecraft-transport-simulator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AKAXBfj.png\" alt=\"核心模组\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/DonBruce64/MTSOfficialPack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uhkx7YA.png\" alt=\"OCP GitHub\" width=\"121\" height=\"121\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/dzdqWWG2dE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mzfdgBd.png\" alt=\"MTS Discord\" width